@display("std/docs")
docs: component(path = "std/docs", lang = "heron") {
  | How the docs generator is configured: its styling, the layout each section uses, the components each slot shows and the modules that render kinds. A tree enters its export once, as `docs { … }`.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/docs/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export           | Specified in                      |
  | | ---------------- | --------------------------------- |
  | | `site`, `docs`   | [the docs generator](#product.system.docs_generator) |
  | | `layout`, `slot` | [the docs generator](#product.system.docs_generator) |

  uses = [language.std.doc, language.std.js]
}
